    "detailed_description": "Pair up all animals with one of their own type to beat each puzzle level<br />\r\nExplore how different animal types, objects, and tiles interact with one another and<br />\r\nUtilize their unique traits to find the optimal solution and earn all 3 stars!<br />\r\nMake and share your own puzzles using Zoolovelogy's handy in-game editor<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\nEasy to grasp but deep gameplay with many different interactions<br />\r\nHundreds of levels (100+ on release)<br />\r\nLots of different animal types, each with their own unique attributes (with more to come!)<br />\r\nVarious tiles and objects that differentiate the gameplay<br />\r\nPuzzle editor so that players can create their own custom levels &amp; share them with others",
